# Signing material must never be committed. The release workflow keeps the
# certificate and API key in $RUNNER_TEMP only, but these patterns stop an
# accidental `git add -A` from publishing them if one is ever placed here.
*.p12
*.pfx
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
*.cer
*.key
.env
.env.*
